Right — the "nationalCode → Redis → API" flow is just *one* business flow. The fix is to make the core pipeline **flow-agnostic** (Kafka in → deserialize → `handler.handle()` → ack/DLT) and move the Redis flow into a **reusable base class** that only the topics that need it extend. Other topics extend different bases or implement the contract directly.

---

## 1. Minimal core contract

The pipeline only knows this:

```java
public interface TopicHandler<T> {

    String topic();
    Class<T> payloadType();

    /** The whole business flow for one message. Whatever this topic needs. */
    Mono<Void> handle(T payload, MessageContext ctx);

    // consumer settings (unchanged from before)
    default String consumerGroup() { return "ncc-" + topic().replace('.', '-'); }
    default Map<String, Object> consumerOverrides() { return Map.of(); }

    /** Optional custom deserialization (Avro, Protobuf, …). Default: Jackson JSON. */
    default Mono<T> deserialize(byte[] raw, ObjectMapper mapper) {
        return Mono.fromCallable(() -> mapper.readValue(raw, payloadType()));
    }
}
```

```java
/** Kafka metadata every flow may need (idempotency keys, tracing, DLT headers…). */
public record MessageContext(String topic, int partition, long offset,
                             String key, Map<String, String> headers, Instant receivedAt) {

    public static MessageContext from(ReceiverRecord<String, byte[]> rec) {
        var h = new HashMap<String, String>();
        rec.headers().forEach(x -> h.put(x.key(), new String(x.value(), UTF_8)));
        return new MessageContext(rec.topic(), rec.partition(), rec.offset(), rec.key(), h, Instant.now());
    }

    /** Stable idempotency key for this exact record. */
    public String idempotencyKey() { return topic + "-" + partition + "-" + offset; }
}
```

The pipeline's `process()` becomes trivial and never changes again:

```java
private <T> Mono<Void> process(TopicHandler<T> handler, String groupId, ReceiverRecord<String, byte[]> rec) {
    var ctx  = MessageContext.from(rec);
    var tags = Tags.of("topic", rec.topic(), "group", groupId);
    var sample = Timer.start(meters);

    return handler.deserialize(rec.value(), mapper)
        .flatMap(payload -> handler.handle(payload, ctx))
        .timeout(props.processing().timeout())
        .doOnSuccess(v -> meters.counter("msg.processed", tags.and("result", "ok")).increment())
        .onErrorResume(err -> {
            meters.counter("msg.processed", tags.and("result", "failed")).increment();
            log.error("[{}] failed {}:{}@{}", groupId, rec.topic(), rec.partition(), rec.offset(), err);
            return dlt.publish(rec, err);
        })
        .doFinally(sig -> {
            rec.receiverOffset().acknowledge();
            sample.stop(meters.timer("msg.latency", tags));
        });
}
```

